  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "the secondary module had entered a failed state on May 12, 2025 due to an internal processor fault and created the latent SPV. On September 24, 2025 at 1829, the primary module faulted and attempted to transfer control to the secondary module. Because the secondary module was already in a failed state, communications were lost and resulted in a thrust bearing trip on both MFPs",
    "cause_code": "TBD",
    "category": "provisional",
    "theme": "latent undetected redundant-module failure creating single point vulnerability",
    "provisional": true
  },
