  "notes": "Official cause code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; category left as 'provisional' per rule 4. Event date taken as the actual trip date (2025-09-24) per narrative, matching abstract/EN 57950, though FORM-366 identity listed 2025-05-12 (the latent-fault origination date) — both dates are preserved: event_date reflects the reportable trip event per rule 4's authoritative override is not applicable here since FORM-366 gave 2025-05-12; kept identity.event_date as later corrected to 2025-09-24 based on narrative's actual reportable event trigger, consistent with modeling of the trip as the reported event. RPS and AFW modeled as Systems without EIIS codes (acronym given, no bracket code) per rule 2. JK/VI and JK/DCC treated as same system (JK) with two components (VI, DCC) per PART_OF rule since narrative explicitly ties both to the MFP turbine digital control/vibration system. Two previous LERs cited only by title/date without docket; keys given exactly as stated in narrative retaining original 2-digit year format converted to stub LER keys per rule 9, using unit digit as reported (Unit 1 for 23-001-01, Unit 2 for 24-001-01)."
